7 1 ShortTitle. Thisactshallbecitedasthe"SpeedingDevelopmentAct".
8 2 Purpose. Thepurposeof thisact istofacilitatespeedierand moreefficient development while
9 ensuring public safety by authorizing licensed or certified third parties to certify documents and
